    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d579">

                <pb facs="0574" n="490" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg490"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 855.48/799b</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Laughlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-10-19T15:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 19, 1918, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2302. For Poland from Hoover:</p>
                <p>For your own information and for reasons will communicate later, Belgian
                    Government may ask and it may be insisted by American <pb facs="0575" n="491"
                        xml:id="pg491"/> Government that C.R.B. continue through reconstruction
                    period. If so, will ask have all relations precisely defined by President.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
